    "title": "Meigs' Carson Davis signs with Cornell | Pomeroy and Meigs County Sports | wvnews.com",
    "text": "ROCK SPRINGS, Ohio - The road from Meigs High School to Cornell University, is approximately 500 miles, but for Meigs senior Carson Davis, the road to Ithaca started years ago as a gym rat in Chesapeake.\nDavis' dad Ryan coached the Panthers before the elder Davis, his wife Renee and family moved to Meigs County to take the boys basketball head coaching job two years ago.",
